## Q46 regression pin: a runtime-dispatch class constructed with the
## paren-less, zero-argument `.new` form must retain valid class-info when
## moved into an `any Mixin` field. Before the fix, `Source.new` skipped the
## class-info header write; dispatch through `Holder.inner` dereferenced null
## and segfaulted before producing stdout.

mixin Readable dispatch runtime
  def read -> Int
end

class Source
  value: Int
  include Readable

  def init
    self.value = 42
  end

  def read -> Int
    self.value
  end
end

class Holder
  inner: any Readable

  def init(inner: any Readable)
    self.inner = inner
  end

  def read -> Int
    (&self.inner).read
  end
end

def main
  var source = Source.new
  var holder = Holder.new(source)
  puts "value=#{holder.read}"
end
